OL,3,ATories pledge to cut benefits for
OL,4,Achildren with 'milder cases' of ADHD
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to save
OL,7,F#2.8bn a year by ending Disability
OL,8,FLiving Allowance (DLA) payments to
OL,9,Ffamilies of children with "milder
OL,10,Fcases" of behavioural disorders,
OL,11,Flearning difficulties or ADHD.
OL,13,FThe policy is one of a series of
OL,14,Fmeasures which the party says will save
OL,15,F#36bn from the welfare budget.
OL,17,FShadow work and pensions secretary
OL,18,FHelen Whately said the system risked
OL,19,Fputting children on a "conveyor belt"
OL,20,Ftowards a "lifetime on benefits".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
