OL,3,ATories pledge to cut benefits for
OL,4,Achildren with 'milder cases' of ADHD
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour described the Tories' plan as a
OL,7,F"charter for homelessness and human
OL,8,Fmisery that would push people into
OL,9,Fhardship and end up costing the state
OL,10,Fmore".
